  "finding": "FullyHealCard routed through general HealCard, adding an alive/location gate, visiting later cancellation callbacks, losing fresh maximum writes and observer-before-self ordering. Its one-int out value was boxed as object[], so Field Hospital healed units but failed the repaired-count draw condition.",
  "changes": [
    "Use clamped total-defense gate without IsAlive, preserve pre-callback requested amount and stop on the first true T12 result.",
    "Write the fresh raw maxDefense after callbacks, preserve saved amount and raw healer ID in cardID/amount/instigatorID notification.",
    "Query/freeze T44 after notice; exclude matching target ID, invoke saved recipients without repeated filtering, then invoke unsuppressed own hook.",
    "Return a scalar int from the dispatch entry so single IR out slot receives an integer; no generalized VM unwrapping change."
  ],
